      <activity id="220783e0-2434-5ad2-8143-178d892f04b5" activityNameId="7be8fb32-b330-57cd-b1b8-f55dbb058ec9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Packaging glass, white, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Packaging glass, white, at regional storage
A production site with a sorting capacity of 100 kt per year and a total life span of 50 a is assumed.;
UUID: 6d36bf06-a935-397b-871f-5da5b0b79b0b
This module includes the average composition of the consumed empty container glass in Switzerland and the therefore needed transport amounts.
Location: average Swiss consumption situation
Technology: Present situation in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Average consumption of empty glass in 2001/2002: 220 kt
Sampling: confidential information from sales department of Vetropack Group, Bülach 
Extrapolations: assumption that the distribution to the countries of origin is similar to the distribution estimated from data of the Swiss boarder statistics (Eidg. Oberzolldirektion)
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6d36bf06-a935-397b-871f-5da5b0b79b0b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
